## Requirements and constraints

- **Upload a copy here** before class. This is what "on file" means.
- **Bring two printed copies.** Your reviewers write on them; you keep them.
- **Bring a pen.** You will be reviewing someone else's draft too.
- **Do not polish at the expense of completeness.** Prose quality is not what is being reviewed today; the argument is.

